From ba49835799995841aa4035d900ef8cc1eb7d3dd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruben van der Linde <ruben@conduction.nl>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:45:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(decidiq): build embargo-geheimhouding [skip ci]

Impose, ratify and dissolve confidentiality restrictions through
ConfidentialityRestrictionService: authority over the imposing body
checked first, an active ground required, the target's existing
classifier driven, ratifiable grounds placed on the body's next
scheduled meeting, and dissolution returning the target to its
non-public default without publishing it.

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
